  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MANAGING MULTIPLE SECTOR THREA-UNDP-CPV-00124661</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to strengthen the systemic and institutional capacity, to reduce multiple threats to globally significant marine ecosystems and achieve sustainable blue growth in Cabo Verde. Cabo Verde&#x2019;s globally significant marine biodiversity faces three broad threats: (i) Marine species are being over-exploited; (ii) Rapidly expanding development threatens fragile marine habitats; and (iii) Climate change is advancing. National frameworks for maritime planning and threat management</narrative>
  </description>
